WEBVTT

00:04:26.086 --> 00:04:30.508
(Applause)

00:04:30.532 --> 00:04:32.150
And the computer models,

00:04:32.174 --> 00:04:33.708
no matter how many that you have

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:35.304
and how many people that you use,

00:04:35.328 --> 00:04:38.241
are never going to be able to arrive
at the same conclusions.

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:42.744
Four years ago I worked with a few people
at the Brookings Institute,

00:04:42.768 --> 00:04:44.431
and I arrived at a conclusion.

00:04:44.886 --> 00:04:50.199
(Laughter)

00:04:52.344 --> 00:04:53.962
Tomorrow is another day.

00:04:53.986 --> 00:04:56.678
(Laughter)

00:04:56.702 --> 00:04:58.401
Not just any day,

00:04:58.425 --> 00:04:59.702
but it is a day.